add(R, `다음 주어진 문장을 괄호 안의 주어진 표현을 사용하여 같은 의미의 문장으로 바꾸어 쓰시오.${FULL}\n\n(1) The girl went home early to take care of her brother. (so that)\n(2) I wrote his name in my diary so that I wouldn't forget it. (so as to)\n\n(1) ______________________________\n(2) ______________________________`, 'The girl went home early so that she could take care of her brother. / I wrote his name in my diary so as not to forget it.', null, { subParts: sp(['The girl went home early so that she could take care of her brother.', 'I wrote his name in my diary so as not to forget it.']) });
