add(R, `다음 글에서 어법상 어색한 부분을 4군데 찾아 올바른 영어로 고쳐 쓰시오.\n\nJørn Utzon, the architect of the Sydney Opera House, took a shape from nature and added his imagine. Can you guess whose inspired him? Many people think that it is the waves in the ocean or a sailing boat. But interesting, the inspiration came from an orange. Look at the roof closely. Can you see the peels of an orange? When orange lights are shine on the building, you can see the peels more clearly.\n\n(1) 어색한 표현 → 고친 표현\n(2) 어색한 표현 → 고친 표현\n(3) 어색한 표현 → 고친 표현\n(4) 어색한 표현 → 고친 표현`, 'imagine → imagination / whose → what / interesting → interestingly / shine → shone', null, { subParts: sp(['imagine → imagination', 'whose → what', 'interesting → interestingly', 'shine → shone']) });
